ed\nREADME.md:124:If you have [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/) installed and authenticated, the script will automatically use your credentials:\nREADME.md:217:![screenshot](issue-123-images/image-1.png)\nREADME.md:249:- [Bun](https://bun.sh/) (>=1.2.0) runtime\nREADME.md:251:  - [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/) (recommended) OR\nREADME.md:291:This project is released into the public domain under The Unlicense - see [LICENSE](LICENSE) file for details.\nREADME.md:299:- [gh-pull-all](https://github.com/link-foundation/gh-pull-all) - Sync all repositories from a GitHub organization or user\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
