x64 Playwright container. # GitHub-hosted runner utilities are not inherited by container jobs.\nsimulate-fresh-merge.sh\t# simulate-fresh-merge.sh # Simulates a fresh merge of the current PR branch with the latest base branch.\nsmoke-test-package.mjs\t\nupdate-preview-images.mjs\t\nuse-module.mjs\t\nvalidate-changeset.mjs\t\nversion-and-commit.mjs\t// Import link-foundation libraries // Loaded through bootstrapDependencies: when installed helpers are unavailable,\nversion-lock.mjs\t\nwait-for-npm.mjs\t// The first check is immediate; 153 ten-second sleeps span 25.5 minutes.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
